# Runtime artwork is delivered by Cloudinary.
/public/wallpapers/**/*.png
/public/images/mascots/masters/*.png
/public/images/pixel-mascots/masters/*.png
/public/images/goofy-mascots/masters/*.png
/public/images/doodle-mascots/masters/*.png

